            "text": "Net::Dropbear versions before 0.14 for Perl contains a vulnerable version of libtomcrypt.  Net::Dropbear versions before 0.14 includes versions of Dropbear 2019.78 or earlier. These include versions of libtomcrypt v1.18.1 or earlier, which is affected by CVE-2016-6129 and CVE-2018-12437.",
